{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600980/extras/steamtext1.png?t=1743917279\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 The year is 198X,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0The powers that be have gone silent,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Humanity is unrestrained, the party will never stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600980/extras/steamtext2.png?t=1743917279\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Vice grips every corner of the city, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Indulgence is at an all-time high, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 A new kind of doctrine festers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600980/extras/steamtext3.png?t=1743917279\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>RitualRX</strong> is a <strong>brutally violent</strong>, <strong>blisteringly fast</strong>, <strong>adrenaline-pumping</strong> shooter set within a pastel paradise ruled by cults. Control a group of excommunicated sinners as you shoot, slash, and slaughter your way through a city where ritual is prescribed and the only treatment administered is an overdose of lead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo, get a taste of RitualRX's\u00a0<strong>Lightning fast and brutal combat</strong> where everything is a weapon. Kick down doors and cave in skulls, throw everything and tackle enemies- ignite, cut, and blast your way through a selection of 3 intricate sandbox-like levels as you master increasingly brutal methods of dispatching your foes.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3600980?t=1743917279","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3600980?t=1743917279","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600980/1316e40b6625fb50b61872a965e50accc472cc63/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743917279","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600980/1316e40b6625fb50b61872a965e50accc472cc63/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743917279","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"RitualRX contains hyperbolic amounts of violence and gore against enemies both inhuman and not. Drug and alcohol use is both depicted and partaken in within the narrative, as well as implications of self-harm and generally distressing topics."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600980